1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,940
Come over now if you
wanna play hide-and-seek!

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:06,440
Me! I'll play!

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:08,860
The girl who wonders,
"Would it be okay for me to join in?"

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,860
Me! I'll play!

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:16,110
and so misses her chance,
ending up all alone.

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,840
Hitori-chan, what's wrong?

7
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:21,040
The girl who ends up all alone at a picnic,

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:19,730
Here you go.

9
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:24,040
swapping parts of her lunch with the teacher.

10
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,380
I'm home.

11
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,840
The girl who doesn't join any clubs,

12
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,720
comes home right after school,

13
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,840
And here, we'll stir-fry it a bit.

14
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:39,020
and finds her smartphone full of
nothing but messages from her parents

15
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,020
There's a lot of vegetables,

16
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,970
and coupon offers.

17
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:42,730
so you can probably make it quickly
if you cut them in advance.

18
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:42,730
That's me.

19
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:44,350
You can probably do that
in the morning, yeah.

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,980
Hitori Goto, first-year in middle school.

21
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,980
Lately I've gotten good at making
so many dishes so quickly

22
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:49,450
I thought I didn't need to know any more,

23
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,450
Sometimes I think

24
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:51,910
I should really change the way I am...

25
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:52,360
but lately I'm learning once again
how interesting cooking can be.

26
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:56,780
But I always stammer when I try to speak,

27
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:59,050
and I'm really bad at keeping eye contact...

28
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:02,780
A life as the archetypal introvert
just seems to fit me best.

29
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,250
Personally I like a lot of options with rice.

30
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:05,110
Oh, of course. But you—

31
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:03,540
You watching this?

32
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:05,110
Nah.

33
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:11,710
Back in school, I was the guy who sat in the
back of the classroom pretending to read.

34
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:13,100
No friends.

35
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:18,220
And now you're part of a band that's
extremely popular with young people!

36
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:21,560
Yeah. A band is a place where
even introverts can shine.

37
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,310
I see!

38
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:28,770
Now, here's "Trigger" by Instorms!

39
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:36,030
What is it?

40
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:38,390
D-Dad, can I use your guitar?

41
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,820
Sure!

42
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:41,380
Th-Thanks!

43
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,340
Aha!

44
00:01:44,340 --> 00:01:46,750
At last, Hitori's getting into guitar too!

45
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:52,820
Maybe even someone like me can shine

46
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:54,750
if I'm in a band!

47
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:10,000
I've made up my mind.

48
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,270
I'm gonna learn to play guitar!

49
00:02:11,270 --> 00:02:12,310
My First Electric Guitar

50
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:14,150
Then I'll form a band at school, and...

51
00:02:12,270 --> 00:02:14,150
Master the Low Chords
*Commonly Used Major Chords

52
00:02:14,770 --> 00:02:17,240
E, A, G...

53
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,990
What's with all the English?

54
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:26,450
Then I'll play at the culture festival

55
00:02:26,450 --> 00:02:29,230
and have everyone go crazy for me!

56
00:02:36,510 --> 00:02:39,510
3 Years Later

57
00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:54,020
Crazy... for me?

58
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:09,460
I liked dark, cramped spaces,

59
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:11,830
so I'd bury my face deep in my hood

60
00:03:11,830 --> 00:03:14,210
My eyes resented the heartless world,

61
00:03:14,210 --> 00:03:17,960
but yearned for love

62
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:24,600
I liked being soaked by the rain,

63
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,970
because my face looked better clouded over

64
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:29,610
I pretended to be afraid of the storm

65
00:03:29,610 --> 00:03:32,440
while waiting for the sky to burst

66
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:39,400
Strum through the light's distortion

67
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:43,820
I want to make thunder roar

68
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:49,620
Drum beyond the pain

69
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:53,750
What can I do? This fierce
pounding is out of control

70
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:59,810
Strum in a harmonizing quartet

71
00:03:59,810 --> 00:04:03,800
I want to cause a revolution

72
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:09,810
Drum in a lamenting forte

73
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:14,560
What can I do? My savage
nature is beyond wild

74
00:04:20,150 --> 00:04:22,860
BOCCHI THE ROCK!

75
00:04:20,150 --> 00:04:22,860
#01 Lonely Rolling Bocchi

76
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:33,640
I practiced six hours every day, so I could
learn how to play in front of people...

77
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,080
The result?

78
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:38,470
Middle school ended, and I
never played a single note for them!

79
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:39,000
Congrats on Graduating!

80
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,860
I never performed once...

81
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,880
98th Annual Graduation Ceremony

82
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:41,880
At the culture festival!

83
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,370
I never put together...

84
00:04:43,370 --> 00:04:44,630
The members for a band!

85
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:47,240
And I never made a single friend...

86
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,480
In three whole years!

87
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,100
Now, in high school...

88
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:53,230
Graduation

89
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:53,230
Yokohama Genseiryo Middle School

90
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:55,020
I gotta form a band or die trying!

91
00:04:56,280 --> 00:05:00,120
But despite my vow, it's been a whole month
since high school started,

92
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,730
and yet my heart remains
grounded in the guitar,

93
00:05:02,730 --> 00:05:07,300
little better than a shut-in...

94
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:11,040
Lyrics and music by me.

95
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,160
From the closet with love.

96
00:05:13,940 --> 00:05:19,160
But before I cause neighborhood problems
playing my crummy original song late at night,

97
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:20,920
Drag & Drop to Upload Video

98
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:20,920
Choose File

99
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:22,300
Upload Video

100
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,750
I've gotta upload a cover
I did of a popular band.

101
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,300
Uploading...

102
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:25,900
It's been a pretty long time
since I started uploading myself

103
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:29,140
playing under the name "guitarhero"
on my dad's advice, but...

104
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:33,770
Wow, my latest video already
has so many comments.

105
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:29,850
